  "title": "Week 23: WWDC 26",
  "date": "2026-06-08T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 23: WWDC 26\n\nLast week, I watched some microsoft build 26 videos. This one about vibe OS is interesting to watch, the web page is totally vibe built in realtime, although it costs a lot and slowly, but looks future.\n\nYesterday was the first day of WWDC2026. The very good thing is that Apple did not give up vision OS, such a relief.\n\nAnd Siri AI although it was remarkable wonderful. It is not usable in both EU and Mainland China. Whatever, I am an iphone 14 pro user, these things are not originally desinged for my device.\n\nThe best thing I think is that they combined the spatial images and gemini inpaint, so that the photo can be adjust angles after is has been shot.\n\nBut I am not planning on upgrading to a beta now. Not so many features looks attractive engough for me to test.",
